<div class="rn">
<h2>What&#x27;s New in 4.7</h2>
<h3>Features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Notify for tracked session activity.</li>
<li>Add a recent worktree switcher to the toolbar.</li>
<li>Order worktrees by latest activity.</li>
<li>Refresh task note dialog.</li>
<li>Open board sessions in the built-in terminal.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>Keep a processing card&#x27;s ring out of the column scroll width.</li>
<li>Read the board transcript dialog at its own type scale.</li>
<li>Reconcile missing worktrees and aborted turns.</li>
<li>Inherit the composer agent and model from fork history.</li>
<li>Offer task-note creation only from the Now column.</li>
<li>Disable Sparkle in debug builds.</li>
</ul>
<p class="more">Full release notes: <a href="https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.7">https://github.com/Ajanth/hive-public/releases/tag/v4.7</a></p>
</div>
